    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Bruiser",
  "YangsThoughts": "Now this I can work with, boss. No finicky pulse lasers or high tech missile launchers to babysit, just honest guns even a Periphery wrench-turner can keep running. Cheap, tough, and it still hides behind that big shield. VEST knew their market.",
